<title>USA: U.S. wheat, corn and barley export inspections.</title>
<headline>U.S. wheat, corn and barley export inspections.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Agriculture Department said the 17.352 million bushels of wheat, 43.858 million of corn and no barley inspected for export in the week ended Oct 31 were for the following shipment from port areas or inland inspection points (1,000 bu).</p>
<p>	     Wheat     Corn	Barley</p>
<p> Lakes	 Nil	Nil	  Nil</p>
<p> Atlantic    Nil	Nil	  Nil</p>
<p> Gulf	7,229   33,086	  Nil</p>
<p> Pacific   9,588    9,570	  Nil</p>
<p> Interior    535    1,202	  Nil</p>
